1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:07,247
Maya's friends want to visit.

3
00:00:07,247 --> 00:00:09,640
They live far away.

4
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:12,686
Each one picks a different road.

5
00:00:12,686 --> 00:00:15,186
One road is bumpy.

6
00:00:15,186 --> 00:00:17,792
One bridge is closed.

7
00:00:17,792 --> 00:00:20,132
One road is long.

8
00:00:20,132 --> 00:00:22,260
They arrive late.

9
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:24,069
And tired.

10
00:00:24,069 --> 00:00:26,835
Boost is one front door.

11
00:00:26,835 --> 00:00:30,518
A glowing doorway at the edge of the sky.

12
00:00:30,518 --> 00:00:33,909
Every visitor goes to Boost first.

13
00:00:33,909 --> 00:00:37,938
Boost sends each one down the fastest road.

14
00:00:37,938 --> 00:00:40,890
Zip keeps copies near you.

15
00:00:40,890 --> 00:00:45,239
Boost gives you one door, and the fastest road.

16
00:00:45,239 --> 00:00:47,779
They all arrive fast.

17
00:00:47,779 --> 00:00:49,760
Maya waves.

18
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:52,140
Now you know Boost!

19
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:56,835
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

